<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🌊 滴滴！收到一份自驾邀请</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-blue: #4fc3f7;
            --dark-blue: #0277bd;
            --bg-color: #e1f5fe;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #37474f;
            --accent-yellow: #ffca28;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 119, 189, 0.1);
            padding: 30px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header-img {
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p.subtitle {
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: #f1f8e9;
            border-left: 5px solid #8bc34a;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: #fafafa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .feature-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #fff9c4;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .feature-text h3 {
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .feature-text p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #607d8b;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 50px;
        }

        button {
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-yes {
            background-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 202, 40, 0.4);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .btn-yes:hover {
            background-color: #ffb300;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .btn-no {
            background-color: #eeeeee;
            color: #9e9e9e;
        }

        /* 简单的动画 */
        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        }

        /* 成功弹窗 */
        #success-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            z-index: 100;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        #success-modal h2 {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .confetti {
            font-size: 50px;
            animation: bounce 1s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            from { transform: translateY(0); }
            to { transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header-img">🚙💨</div>
        <h1>嘿！一起去土耳其D400自驾吗？</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">我发现了一条全球最美海岸线，一边是峭壁一边是地中海，感觉简直是为我们量身定制的旅行！</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            📍 <b>路线剧透：</b> 费特希耶 ➡️ 卡什 ➡️ 卡普塔什 ➡️ 安塔利亚
        </div>

        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">📸</div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <h3>悬崖与绝美出片</h3>
                    <p>带上长焦镜头！从悬崖公路上俯拍果冻海，视觉压缩感绝对震撼。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">🐈</div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <h3>小镇发呆与撸猫</h3>
                    <p>在卡什小镇找个海滨咖啡馆，吹吹海风，路上遇到的土耳其小猫我们可以一路逗过去~</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">🍢</div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <h3>海滩与日落大餐</h3>
                    <p>白天去卡普塔什海滩踩水，晚上找个风景好的地方一起吃顿海鲜大餐或者海边烤肉，美滋滋！</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3>冲不冲？😎</h3>
        <div class="actions">
            <button class="btn-yes" onclick="acceptInvite()">走起！马上排休安排</button>
            <button class="btn-no" id="btn-no" onmouseover="dodge()">不去，我再想想</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 成功后的全屏提示 -->
    <div id="success-modal">
        <div class="confetti">🎉</div>
        <h2>太棒了！就知道你会同意！</h2>
        <p>赶紧把护照和驾照准备好，我们来做攻略啦！✈️</p>
        <button class="btn-yes" onclick="closeModal()">关掉窗口，开始期待</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        // 拒绝按钮的逃跑逻辑
        const noBtn = document.getElementById('btn-no');
        
        function dodge() {
            // 获取窗口可见区域的宽和高
            const windowWidth = window.innerWidth;
            const windowHeight = window.innerHeight;
            
            // 计算随机位置，留出一点边界防止飞出屏幕
            const randomX = Math.floor(Math.random() * (windowWidth - 150));
            const randomY = Math.floor(Math.random() * (windowHeight - 50));
            
            // 把按钮变成绝对定位并移动
            noBtn.style.position = 'fixed';
            noBtn.style.left = randomX + 'px';
            noBtn.style.top = randomY + 'px';
            noBtn.style.transition = 'all 0.1s ease';
        }

        // 手机端为了防止悬停不生效，增加点击逃跑
        noBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            dodge();
        });

        // 同意按钮的逻辑
        function acceptInvite() {
            document.getElementById('success-modal').style.display = 'flex';
        }

        function closeModal() {
            document.getElementById('success-modal').style.display = 'none';
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
